        "id": "tab-nri-presets",
        "type": "tab",
        "label": "Interactive Inject — Preset Buttons",
        "disabled": false,
        "info": "Demonstrates the interactive-inject node in **Preset buttons** mode.\n\n- Click any canvas button to inject its pre-configured value.\n- Hover over a button to preview its value in the status strip below the buttons.\n- The last-clicked button is highlighted with a blue border and is also fired by the left inject arrow.\n\nThree nodes show different payload types:\n- **ESS Mode** — numeric presets (integer mode codes)\n- **HVAC** — boolean and string presets\n- **Light scene** — JSON object presets"
